&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Aptos is a people-first blockchain on a mission to help billions of people achieve universal and fair access to decentralized assets in a safe and scalable way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Founded by some of the original creators and maintainers that researched, designed, and built the Diem blockchain to serve this purpose, we have dedicated several years toward this mission. We believe the open-source Diem technology we have developed is an important foundation of a safe and scalable web3 world where everyone has more equitable opportunities to grow and access financial assets with lower fees and fewer intermediaries.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Aptos (Ohlone for &quot;The People&quot;) encompasses our mission and ethos for why we build.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;306&quot; data-end=&quot;621&quot;&gt;Shelby is a high-performance object storage platform with a global namespace, purpose-built for AI and large-scale, data-intensive workloads. It enables organizations to store data once and access it from anywhere—bringing data closer to compute while delivering cloud-grade performance at significantly lower cost.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;623&quot; data-end=&quot;948&quot;&gt;As AI infrastructure becomes increasingly distributed, organizations need data platforms that support training, inference, and global collaboration without complex or expensive data replication. Shelby’s “write once, read anywhere” architecture simplifies global data movement across regions, teams, and compute environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;950&quot; data-end=&quot;1245&quot;&gt;Designed for secure, high-throughput, read-optimized access patterns, Shelby plays a critical role across the AI data lifecycle—from data acquisition to model training to inference. The platform can also be deployed within select datacenters, enabling flexible, hybrid infrastructure strategies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1247&quot; data-end=&quot;1377&quot;&gt;Shelby is built by a team with deep experience in large-scale infrastructure, distributed systems, and production-grade platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1379&quot; data-end=&quot;1382&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1froeg&quot; data-start=&quot;1384&quot; data-end=&quot;1395&quot;&gt;The Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1397&quot; data-end=&quot;1517&quot;&gt;We’re hiring a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1412&quot; data-end=&quot;1438&quot;&gt;Head of Enterprise GTM&lt;/strong&gt; to define and lead Shelby’s enterprise go-to-market motion from the ground up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1519&quot; data-end=&quot;1847&quot;&gt;This is a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1529&quot; data-end=&quot;1541&quot;&gt;0→1 role&lt;/strong&gt; for someone who has taken complex AI, data, or cloud platforms and turned them into real enterprise adoption and revenue. You will translate Shelby’s technical capabilities into clear business value, land initial customers, and shape how the platform is understood and deployed within large organizations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1849&quot; data-end=&quot;2008&quot;&gt;You will operate as both a strategist and an operator—owning early revenue, building the narrative, and laying the foundation for a scalable enterprise motion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;2010&quot; data-end=&quot;2013&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;r8dte7&quot; data-start=&quot;2015&quot; data-end=&quot;2034&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2036&quot; data-end=&quot;2246&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2036&quot; data-end=&quot;2063&quot;&gt;Enterprise GTM Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;2063&quot; data-end=&quot;2066&quot;&gt;Define and execute Shelby’s positioning across AI infrastructure, data platforms, and distributed compute. Translate technical capabilities into clear enterprise use cases and ROI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2248&quot; data-end=&quot;2432&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2248&quot; data-end=&quot;2278&quot;&gt;Strategic Enterprise Sales&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;2278&quot; data-end=&quot;2281&quot;&gt;Own and close early lighthouse accounts. Lead complex, multi-stakeholder sales cycles across technical and executive buyers within large organizations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2434&quot; data-end=&quot;2590&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2434&quot; data-end=&quot;2464&quot;&gt;Platform Commercialization&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;2464&quot; data-end=&quot;2467&quot;&gt;Turn Shelby from a technical platform into a clear enterprise solution by shaping use cases, pilots, and adoption pathways.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2592&quot; data-end=&quot;2742&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2592&quot; data-end=&quot;2620&quot;&gt;Partnerships &amp;amp; Ecosystem&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;2620&quot; data-end=&quot;2623&quot;&gt;Develop relationships with AI, cloud, and infrastructure partners to accelerate adoption and expand Shelby’s footprint.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2744&quot; data-end=&quot;2895&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2744&quot; data-end=&quot;2775&quot;&gt;Cross-Functional Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;2775&quot; data-end=&quot;2778&quot;&gt;Work closely with product and engineering to align customer needs with roadmap, positioning, and deployment strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2897&quot; data-end=&quot;3014&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2897&quot; data-end=&quot;2917&quot;&gt;Build the Motion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;2917&quot; data-end=&quot;2920&quot;&gt;Establish early playbooks, define ICPs, and build toward a repeatable enterprise sales engine.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;3016&quot; data-end=&quot;3019&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1uwd9qn&quot; data-start=&quot;3021&quot; data-end=&quot;3046&quot;&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3048&quot; data-end=&quot;3790&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;uiyjqw&quot; data-start=&quot;3048&quot; data-end=&quot;3145&quot;&gt;10+ years in enterprise GTM, sales, or partnerships across AI, data, cloud, or infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;3imnz0&quot; data-start=&quot;3146&quot; data-end=&quot;3345&quot;&gt;Experience at platforms like &lt;span class=&quot;hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Google Cloud&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&quot;hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Microsoft&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, or &lt;span class=&quot;hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Salesforce&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;trvags&quot; data-start=&quot;3346&quot; data-end=&quot;3444&quot;&gt;Proven ability to take complex technical platforms from &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3404&quot; data-end=&quot;3442&quot;&gt;early stage to enterprise adoption&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1uyjjhf&quot; data-start=&quot;3445&quot; data-end=&quot;3540&quot;&gt;Strong track record selling into Fortune 500 environments with multi-stakeholder complexity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1mgi5sn&quot; data-start=&quot;3541&quot; data-end=&quot;3660&quot;&gt;Ability to engage both technical and executive audiences and translate platform capabilities into business outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;3crkef&quot; data-start=&quot;3661&quot; data-end=&quot;3724&quot;&gt;Experience operating in ambiguous, zero-to-one environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ap6se&quot; data-start=&quot;3725&quot; data-end=&quot;3790&quot;&gt;Strong communication, storytelling, and deal execution skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;3792&quot; data-end=&quot;3795&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1tcakoa&quot; data-start=&quot;3797&quot; data-end=&quot;3810&quot;&gt;Why Shelby&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3812&quot; data-end=&quot;4085&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;etljck&quot; data-start=&quot;3812&quot; data-end=&quot;3892&quot;&gt;Define how a next-generation AI infrastructure platform is brought to market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;18qlqxf&quot; data-start=&quot;3893&quot; data-end=&quot;3957&quot;&gt;Own enterprise adoption from first customer to scaled growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;gnbmno&quot; data-start=&quot;3958&quot; data-end=&quot;4023&quot;&gt;Work at the intersection of AI, data, and distributed compute&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;l7ul3p&quot; data-start=&quot;4024&quot; data-end=&quot;4085&quot;&gt;Partner with a team building category-defining technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;100% insurance premium coverage for medical, dental, and vision for you and your dependents (US Employees)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Equipment of your choice&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Flexible vacation time, 11 holidays, and floating company days off&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive Salary&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Protocol Token Grants&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;401k matching (US Employees)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Fun and inclusive in-person and digital events&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Aptos is committed to diversity in the workplace, and we’re proud to be an Equal Opportunity Employer. We do not hire on the basis of race, color, religion, creed, gender, national origin, citizenship, age, disability, veteran status, marital status, pregnancy, parental status, sex, gender expression or identity, sexual orientation, or any other basis protected by local, state or federal law. All employment is decided based on qualifications, merit, and business need.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
